<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Sept oil output falls to 86,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Sept oil output falls to 86,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV CRUDE OIL AND GAS EXTRACTION</p>
<p>					   Sept 96     Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p> crude petroleum (tonnes)	   86,000     87,000	89,000</p>
<p> natural gas (million cu.meters)	53	   52	    85</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
